+
+This link-relocated copy preserves the earlier wording. Its no-publication statements describe the earlier local compilation, not this approved public edition. Later qualifications are in CORRECTIONS.md and beside affected entries. Original-byte SHA-256: `a2d5471865d53261114da9c713824ec4ca067db2dc7a652021a0a0a82087b262`.
