+# WTC 7 investigation — master lead list
+
+October 25, 2026. Local working compilation; not an expert report, agency record, finding of conspiracy, or legal filing.
+
+**131 entries: all 88 inherited entries plus 43 additions/clarifications. This is not a count of independent anomalies.**
+
+New to this register does not mean newly discovered today. Source-report observations, attributed disputes, unperformed tests, tooling limits and counterevidence are explicitly separated. No historical cause, actor, numerical odds or systematic manipulation is established by accumulation.
+
+## Important update to the earlier conversation
+
+A separate October 24 study acquired a candidate UAF SAP2000 native package. Broad wording that no native UAF case is held is now outdated. This does not establish that Column 79 Model-9/Model-10 was acquired or that any UAF result was reproduced. See M103–M108. The earlier scoped availability record remains preserved.
+
+## Read these additions first
+
+- [M089](#m089): repeated unequal ANSYS assignments, distinct from the earlier LS-DYNA finding.
+- [M093](#m093), [M095](#m095), [M129](#m129): caption/panel clock conflicts and the proxy underlying the cited timing agreement.
+- [M101](#m101), [M130](#m130), [M131](#m131): UAF PDF-layer labels, a conditional expansion-percentage ambiguity and a confounded side-plate comparison.
+- [M103](#m103)–[M108](#m108): actual new native UAF holdings, two warning eigenvalues, active/inactive case distinctions and unrun dynamics.
+- [M109](#m109)–[M116](#m116): specimen/custody and operational leads, kept separate from a demonstrated demolition mechanism.
+- [M117](#m117): a reproducible digital audio feature that is not yet an identified explosion.
+- [M120](#m120), [M122](#m122), [M126](#m126): material/contact and experimental counterchecks that prevent overstating the criticisms.
+
+## How to use this list
+
+- M001–M088 preserve the current technical-index records and numbering verbatim. Their source reviews have differing verification scopes.
+- M089 onward add concrete details, separate lead families and contrary findings; each includes exact source-report lines, a hash-pinned excerpt, relevance, limits and a next discriminator.
+- Source links to our notes are navigation, not independent primary evidence. Original public URLs are retained where established. No final chemical result, historical run, missing specimen bridge or unavailable video payload is invented.
+- Preserve every conflicting record. Assessing weight or correcting our interpretation is separate from overwriting evidence. Existing sources and public history are unchanged.
+- Access failures, numerical warnings, metadata differences and unperformed sensitivity tests are not automatically engineering defects, evidence destruction or intent.
+- This local list includes source paths to local-only research. It is NOT an approved public export. No outreach, commit or push was performed.
